              "text": "Okay, but actually I want to make a modification to that. Let's say that a filament that is perfectly perpendicular to the time surface, that is, that it is parallel to the motion of the time surface, let's say that filament has zero friction, let's call it that for now, with the time surface, and therefore is vacuum. And as the angle increases, then mass would therefore increase.",
